# Cell types

The notebook-kit library supports many cell types. The tiddller `type` field is used to determine the type.

- text/x-markdown - markdown
- text/x-typescript - typescript
- application/javascript - javascript
- text/html - html
- text/vnd.graphviz - graphviz dot
- text/x-tex - latex math markup

Javascript string interpolation is performed on all such cells. ${"`${greet}`"} = **${greet}**
